    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Developers quote: &quot; Diablo 2 meets Skyrim in a epic tale with its own lore ! &quot;</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/cf544c936b79be5f58743d0b868cdf57.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/47f384304ec7c47b609677d6e5767ca6.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/47f384304ec7c47b609677d6e5767ca6.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/47f384304ec7c47b609677d6e5767ca6.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Harnessing the power of elemental magic, you select your affinity </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">among the primordial forces: fire, water, earth, wind\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the realm of Everdawn, the ancient threat known as the Void looms ominously, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">seeking to engulf the world in eternal chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a chosen wielder of light and arcane energies, you embark on a perilous quest to thwart this malevolent force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roaming through diverse landscapes, your presence stirs the dormant darkness, forcing its sinister denizens to materialize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/80877ed3a5b69126cdb58fde3e9180af.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/74dbca0705b51464621ea3c6972f5ca8.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/74dbca0705b51464621ea3c6972f5ca8.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/74dbca0705b51464621ea3c6972f5ca8.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In battle, each vanquished foe releases shimmering Void orbs, relics brimming with corrupted energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By aiding the enigmatic seer Zara, a guardian of ancient wisdom, you unlock the secrets of these orbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zara's guidance empowers you with passive skills and insights, purchased through the harmonious synthesis of light and Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an expedition through the vast expanse of the Town map, a sprawling zone </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">teeming with otherworldly wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each corner of this mysterious realm unveils unique worlds adorned with fantastical flora </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and eccentric fungi, a testament to the realm's enigmatic history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/d530c16c725e15929fff9337f23e4925.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/d530c16c725e15929fff9337f23e4925.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/d530c16c725e15929fff9337f23e4925.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amidst your exploration, encounter five peculiar shops offering exotic wares and arcane </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">artifacts essential for your quest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Safeguard your discoveries within the confines of your home chest, the sole sanctuary in </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">this unpredictable landscape where treasures remain secure against the encroaching chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To expand your storage capacity, seek out ancient runes scattered across the land. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>These mystical items serve as enchanted pouches, enhancing your ability to safeguard </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>and organize your burgeoning collection of relics and curiosities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture deeper into the world, find ancient ruins, long forgotten by time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot these venerable sites to uncover relics of immense power and untold secrets, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">piecing together the cryptic tapestry of Everdawn's past while fortifying your resolve against </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the encroaching Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>** Magic Only **</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>**No weapons**</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/9df6ce932bd51ad37cbeb2691301ede6.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/ae92a33a900d5475b85a6225a537aa9b.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/ae92a33a900d5475b85a6225a537aa9b.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/ae92a33a900d5475b85a6225a537aa9b.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Delve into a realm of endless gear combinations and unique traits, where every choice shapes your destiny!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/be5429fc96701c15eab82f1e87357771.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/846ee53d0b0d658cd3dce04372d14868.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/846ee53d0b0d658cd3dce04372d14868.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/846ee53d0b0d658cd3dce04372d14868.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thus, armed with elemental prowess and guided by ancient wisdom, you venture forth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">into the heart of Everdawn to cleanse the land of the encroaching shadows and restore </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">balance to a world on the brink of oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend into treacherous dungeons, where each step brings peril and potential. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In these shadowed depths, every defeat exacts a heavy toll:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>loss of precious loot and hard-earned passive skills.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet, amid the danger lies unparalleled opportunity for gear progression, with each delve yielding </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">rare materials vital for enhancing your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A special merchant is hidden in the caverns on the HARD and INSANE dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hidden merchants offer's items crucial to gear progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/a189f8226ff03b35275000473ee70d8c.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div>Harness the ancient arts of crafting and alchemy at specialized stations strewn across the realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of potion brewing, where the initial refining process yields a bountiful harvest, providing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">an invaluable advantage in your quest against the encroaching Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize the spoils of your conquests to fashion bespoke gear, each piece a testament to your prowess </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and resilience. Merge the essence of your discoveries into formidable equipment, forging a legacy destined to defy chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft and refine potions at special stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refining the first stage of potions yields twice the input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through meticulous refinement, forge potent elixirs that can turn the tide of battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/83818f5589b10fba837ff6fe9a374e8b.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/83818f5589b10fba837ff6fe9a374e8b.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/83818f5589b10fba837ff6fe9a374e8b.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Potion of uncertain demise of power: Drink this and get 7x damage multiplier for 2 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                              50% chance to die upon drinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/cc5b25c1ef1fe729cd6583ea274e1aaa.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand firm against the onslaught, for the fate of Everdawn hangs in the balance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only through cunning strategy and unwavering determination can you safeguard the sanctity of your crystal and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">push back the relentless waves of the Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon forth relentless waves of adversaries, drawn like moths to the flame of your unwavering resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the enemy masses converge upon your sanctuary, fortify its defences with a strategic array of towers, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">each a testament to your mastery of arcane engineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every tower built and upgraded, bolster the crystal's protection against the relentless tide of Void. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash the elemental energies at your command, infusing each structure with the power to repel and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">vanquish the encroaching chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">**Alpha has 1 tower model that can be upgraded x3.**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/70a9381c078e6681f27b8db9ce33866c.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/70a9381c078e6681f27b8db9ce33866c.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/70a9381c078e6681f27b8db9ce33866c.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One Lane per map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the crystal gets hit by ONE enemy, you loose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full body physics; you can trip and fall. Be thrown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Same for enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First beginners guide<br><br>Check youtube link in the right steam panel<br>On top of Discord link</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*** Tutorial is 16 min. You will need minimum 1 hour of gameplay to NUKE ***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha is solo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open world town map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Called Hall of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shop keep that keeps player listings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 dungeons with each its unique boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extractor type dungeons with exit portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tower defence map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 waves to select from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 tower to build and upgrade x2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Current state of game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Alpha*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*** One person studio ***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Studio Promises:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will NEVER be or will NEVER have:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Pay to win</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Crypto infused</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- DLC packs extra $</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Paying for character storage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Hidden Charges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Subscription Based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Account levels. silver/gold...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beta will be Co-op 2-6 players per map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Destructible environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Mount system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Player driven economy.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Developers quote: &quot; Diablo 2 meets Skyrim in a epic tale with its own lore ! &quot;</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/cf544c936b79be5f58743d0b868cdf57.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/47f384304ec7c47b609677d6e5767ca6.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/47f384304ec7c47b609677d6e5767ca6.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/47f384304ec7c47b609677d6e5767ca6.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Harnessing the power of elemental magic, you select your affinity </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">among the primordial forces: fire, water, earth, wind\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the realm of Everdawn, the ancient threat known as the Void looms ominously, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">seeking to engulf the world in eternal chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a chosen wielder of light and arcane energies, you embark on a perilous quest to thwart this malevolent force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roaming through diverse landscapes, your presence stirs the dormant darkness, forcing its sinister denizens to materialize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/80877ed3a5b69126cdb58fde3e9180af.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/74dbca0705b51464621ea3c6972f5ca8.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/74dbca0705b51464621ea3c6972f5ca8.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/74dbca0705b51464621ea3c6972f5ca8.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In battle, each vanquished foe releases shimmering Void orbs, relics brimming with corrupted energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By aiding the enigmatic seer Zara, a guardian of ancient wisdom, you unlock the secrets of these orbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zara's guidance empowers you with passive skills and insights, purchased through the harmonious synthesis of light and Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an expedition through the vast expanse of the Town map, a sprawling zone </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">teeming with otherworldly wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each corner of this mysterious realm unveils unique worlds adorned with fantastical flora </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and eccentric fungi, a testament to the realm's enigmatic history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/d530c16c725e15929fff9337f23e4925.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/d530c16c725e15929fff9337f23e4925.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/d530c16c725e15929fff9337f23e4925.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amidst your exploration, encounter five peculiar shops offering exotic wares and arcane </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">artifacts essential for your quest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Safeguard your discoveries within the confines of your home chest, the sole sanctuary in </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">this unpredictable landscape where treasures remain secure against the encroaching chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To expand your storage capacity, seek out ancient runes scattered across the land. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>These mystical items serve as enchanted pouches, enhancing your ability to safeguard </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>and organize your burgeoning collection of relics and curiosities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture deeper into the world, find ancient ruins, long forgotten by time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot these venerable sites to uncover relics of immense power and untold secrets, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">piecing together the cryptic tapestry of Everdawn's past while fortifying your resolve against </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the encroaching Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>** Magic Only **</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>**No weapons**</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/9df6ce932bd51ad37cbeb2691301ede6.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/ae92a33a900d5475b85a6225a537aa9b.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/ae92a33a900d5475b85a6225a537aa9b.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/ae92a33a900d5475b85a6225a537aa9b.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Delve into a realm of endless gear combinations and unique traits, where every choice shapes your destiny!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/be5429fc96701c15eab82f1e87357771.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/846ee53d0b0d658cd3dce04372d14868.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/846ee53d0b0d658cd3dce04372d14868.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/846ee53d0b0d658cd3dce04372d14868.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thus, armed with elemental prowess and guided by ancient wisdom, you venture forth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">into the heart of Everdawn to cleanse the land of the encroaching shadows and restore </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">balance to a world on the brink of oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend into treacherous dungeons, where each step brings peril and potential. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In these shadowed depths, every defeat exacts a heavy toll:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>loss of precious loot and hard-earned passive skills.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet, amid the danger lies unparalleled opportunity for gear progression, with each delve yielding </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">rare materials vital for enhancing your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A special merchant is hidden in the caverns on the HARD and INSANE dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hidden merchants offer's items crucial to gear progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/a189f8226ff03b35275000473ee70d8c.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div>Harness the ancient arts of crafting and alchemy at specialized stations strewn across the realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of potion brewing, where the initial refining process yields a bountiful harvest, providing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">an invaluable advantage in your quest against the encroaching Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize the spoils of your conquests to fashion bespoke gear, each piece a testament to your prowess </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and resilience. Merge the essence of your discoveries into formidable equipment, forging a legacy destined to defy chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft and refine potions at special stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refining the first stage of potions yields twice the input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through meticulous refinement, forge potent elixirs that can turn the tide of battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/83818f5589b10fba837ff6fe9a374e8b.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/83818f5589b10fba837ff6fe9a374e8b.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/83818f5589b10fba837ff6fe9a374e8b.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Potion of uncertain demise of power: Drink this and get 7x damage multiplier for 2 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                              50% chance to die upon drinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/cc5b25c1ef1fe729cd6583ea274e1aaa.avif?t=1729685856\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand firm against the onslaught, for the fate of Everdawn hangs in the balance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only through cunning strategy and unwavering determination can you safeguard the sanctity of your crystal and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">push back the relentless waves of the Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon forth relentless waves of adversaries, drawn like moths to the flame of your unwavering resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the enemy masses converge upon your sanctuary, fortify its defences with a strategic array of towers, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">each a testament to your mastery of arcane engineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every tower built and upgraded, bolster the crystal's protection against the relentless tide of Void. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash the elemental energies at your command, infusing each structure with the power to repel and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">vanquish the encroaching chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">**Alpha has 1 tower model that can be upgraded x3.**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/70a9381c078e6681f27b8db9ce33866c.poster.avif?t=1729685856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/70a9381c078e6681f27b8db9ce33866c.webm?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195190/extras/70a9381c078e6681f27b8db9ce33866c.mp4?t=1729685856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One Lane per map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the crystal gets hit by ONE enemy, you loose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full body physics; you can trip and fall. Be thrown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Same for enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First beginners guide<br><br>Check youtube link in the right steam panel<br>On top of Discord link</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*** Tutorial is 16 min. You will need minimum 1 hour of gameplay to NUKE ***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha is solo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open world town map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Called Hall of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shop keep that keeps player listings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 dungeons with each its unique boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extractor type dungeons with exit portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tower defence map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 waves to select from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 tower to build and upgrade x2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Current state of game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Alpha*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*** One person studio ***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Studio Promises:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will NEVER be or will NEVER have:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Pay to win</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Crypto infused</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- DLC packs extra $</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Paying for character storage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Hidden Charges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Subscription Based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Account levels. silver/gold...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beta will be Co-op 2-6 players per map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Destructible environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Mount system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Player driven economy.</p>",
